    "title": "Omaha police investigate body found of transient near I-480 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Bell ,\n13 hours ago OMAHA, Neb. (WOWT) - Omaha Police have identified the remains of a person found near I-480 on Tuesday afternoon. Jennifer Lynn Chapman, 76, was found at the embankment of the interstate near 29th and Douglas Streets. A passerby reported seeing Chapman and it was determined that Chapman was a transient. Read full article\n6",
